  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has distinct real roots and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has only one real root, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "L0GjE",
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6uiIk",
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hUzST",
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ainJ6",
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has distinct real roots and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has only one real root<br />So, one root of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;will be zero and the other root will be negative.<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dcf29ffb-d476-4b42-b55f-fd37ca42b46e.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.59375in;height:1.59375in\" />",
    "image": null
  },
